0..74 Comment "// A sum by recursion on its second summand whose first grows from call to"
75..153 Comment "// call: the fixpoint stages its second parameter and carries the first, which"
154..231 Comment "// every recursive call changes, through the stuck form, readback, conversion"
232..266 Comment "// and the kernel\'s replay (#626)."
